<title>UK: Lloyds tells shareholders to take no action.</title>
<headline>Lloyds tells shareholders to take no action.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lloyds Chemists board told its shareholders on Friday to take no action on UniChem's offer which values the ordinary shares at 505.4 pence per share.</p>
<p>Lloyds also noted the subsequent announcement by GEHE AG of Germany  that the company continued to be interested and that it was evaluating its position.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
